{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787465282981552660,"compiled_state":{"alias":"alamode-greasy-jerboa","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"153117193e1ad35d59c53570091e0773bb51f05eacb49588155e0098200f8125","event_uuid":"e7bd9ddd-1edc-4376-8383-a58f562f4bf8","position":{"commit_sha":"062a3195014c1d532ae1e9b3d526c1b09d88e776","position":"1787462410526395001-e7bd9ddd-1edc-4376-8383-a58f562f4bf8"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"844a26a01b5fdd913b44c688de8f17eab506fa2781c8cf3ca345da418580e4ba","event_uuid":"c9fd2f49-9bdc-4a92-b64c-ef31a42f05aa","position":{"commit_sha":"c7e94729523bb6f70c37c149ea6bbbe90e5de31f","position":"1787462437338076001-c9fd2f49-9bdc-4a92-b64c-ef31a42f05aa"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787462410526395001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"c9fd2f49-9bdc-4a92-b64c-ef31a42f05aa","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"65c9-aba3-c744-483a"}],"description":"## Context\nF12 makes committed help available for every visible route that is not retired and uses those artifacts to generate the CLI reference. Manual review found writing-guideline violations in newly exposed help and reference text. The affected output inherits parser descriptions and help strings that predate the documentation policy. Examples occur in help for `verify-completion`, `sign-review`, `explain`, `verify-identity`, and `remote-cert`, along with overview summaries. F08A and F10 do not provide general coverage for parser-owned CLI help. The operator rejected character restrictions and other mechanical prose enforcement.\n\n## Proposed remediation\n- Inventory writing-guideline violations in committed CLI help and the generated CLI reference.\n- Trace every affected generated line to its parser description, option help, or other source string.\n- Rewrite the source strings manually for an external user audience while preserving command meaning, technical identifiers, and argparse behavior.\n- Regenerate committed help and the CLI reference through the existing generators.\n- Use drift checks and content-specific behavior tests. Do not add a character gate, banned-word scanner, punctuation scanner, or similar mechanical enforcement.\n- Record any wording that cannot be changed because it is an interoperability token, syntax form, quoted third-party value, or stable machine contract.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The affected committed help and CLI reference prose conforms to the project writing guidelines.\n- [ ] Each changed generated line is corrected at its maintained source.\n- [ ] Command semantics, syntax, technical identifiers, and exit behavior remain unchanged.\n- [ ] The help and CLI-reference drift checks pass.\n- [ ] Focused CLI help contracts pass.\n- [ ] No mechanical character or prose enforcement is introduced.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["documentation","proposal","cli"],"ticket_id":"5b4f-2072-3057-4dfe","ticket_type":"task","title":"F20 align generated CLI help with documentation writing guidelines","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e7bd9ddd-1edc-4376-8383-a58f562f4bf8","c9fd2f49-9bdc-4a92-b64c-ef31a42f05aa"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787465282981552660,"uuid":"3ba5cb63-945a-46f9-92dc-84556bdb0290"}